  "description": "★ Product Description: Scratch Removal Wax 60ml | Car Body Scratch Remover Kit Revive the flawless finish of your vehicle with the Scratch Removal Wax 60ml. This professional grade Car Body Scratch Remover Kit is designed to effortlessly remove minor scratches, swirl marks, and surface blemishes from cars, motorcycles, and bikes. The high-performance Paint Scratch Repair Wax restores the original shine and luster of your vehicle’s paintwork without damaging the surface. Whether it's light scuffs or oxidation, this easy-to-use Body Cream Wax delivers long-lasting protection and a polished look. How to Use: 1. Clean the area to be treated and ensure it is dry. 2. Apply a small amount of the wax onto the included sponge. 3. Gently rub in a circular motion until the scratch or mark is no longer visible. 4. Wipe off any excess product with a clean, dry cloth. 5. Buff the surface for a high-gloss finish. Restore your vehicle’s beauty effortlessly with this Scratch Removal Wax Kit—your go-to solution for maintaining a pristine paint job!",
